---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  nav="book"
  title="Book a Fitting — Sam's Menswear · Vaughan"
  description="Book a personal fitting with Sam, in Vaughan or Thornhill. By appointment only. Closed Shabbos and Yom Tov."
>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div data-reveal>
        <div class="eyebrow-rule">The Atelier &middot; Vaughan</div>
        <h1>Three ways to <em>begin.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">Pick whichever way is easiest. First consultations are unhurried, candid, and obligation-free &mdash; whether at the atelier, in your dining room, or on a quick video call.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PATH PICKER -->
  <section class="section tight">
    <div class="container">

      <div class="path-grid" data-reveal-stagger>

        <button type="button" class="path-card is-recommended" data-open-booking data-where="atelier">
          <div class="pc-tag">Most popular</div>
          <svg class="pc-icon" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M6 34 L 6 18 L 20 6 L 34 18 L 34 34 Z"/>
            <path d="M14 34 L 14 22 L 26 22 L 26 34"/>
            <circle cx="22" cy="28" r="1" fill="currentColor"/>
          </svg>
          <h3 class="pc-title">Visit <em>Sam</em></h3>
          <p class="pc-copy">A 90-minute consultation at the Vaughan atelier. Measure, taste cloths, draw the first jacket together. Coffee, pellegrino, the whole conversation unhurried.</p>
          <div class="pc-meta">Book the visit</div>
        </button>

        <button type="button" class="path-card" data-open-booking data-where="home">
          <div class="pc-tag">For wedding parties &amp; busy weeks</div>
          <svg class="pc-icon" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <rect x="6" y="14" width="28" height="20" rx="1"/>
            <path d="M12 14 L 12 10 Q 12 8 14 8 L 26 8 Q 28 8 28 10 L 28 14"/>
            <line x1="20" y1="20" x2="20" y2="28"/>
            <line x1="16" y1="24" x2="24" y2="24"/>
          </svg>
          <h3 class="pc-title">Have Sam <em>over</em></h3>
          <p class="pc-copy">For wedding parties of six or more, executives with no commute time, and clients who'd rather host. Sam brings the tape, the cloth book, and the notebook.</p>
          <div class="pc-meta">Schedule a house visit</div>
        </button>

        <button type="button" class="path-card" data-open-booking data-where="video">
          <div class="pc-tag">No travel · 30 minutes</div>
          <svg class="pc-icon" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <rect x="4" y="10" width="22" height="20" rx="1"/>
            <path d="M26 16 L 36 10 L 36 30 L 26 24 Z"/>
            <circle cx="15" cy="20" r="2"/>
          </svg>
          <h3 class="pc-title">A <em>video</em> consultation</h3>
          <p class="pc-copy">Best for first-time clients across the city or out of town. Sam takes you through cloths and styles on screen; we book the in-person fitting at the end.</p>
          <div class="pc-meta">Set up the video</div>
        </button>

      </div>

      <!-- QUICK CALLBACK -->
      <div class="callback-rail" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <div class="chapter-no" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Or skip the form &mdash;</div>
          <h3>Just leave <em>your number.</em></h3>
          <p>Sam (or someone in the family) calls back the same business day. No commitment, no schedule to navigate &mdash; just a quick conversation about what you have in mind.</p>
        </div>

        <form id="callback-form">
          <div class="form-row">
            <label for="cb-name">Name</label>
            <input id="cb-name" type="text" placeholder="As you'd like to be addressed" required/>
          </div>
          <div class="form-row">
            <label for="cb-phone">Phone</label>
            <input id="cb-phone" type="tel" placeholder="+1 (000) 000-0000" required/>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn is-dark" style="color: var(--ink); border-color: var(--ink);">Call me back</button>
        </form>
        <div id="callback-confirm" hidden style="grid-column: 1 / -1; margin-top: 16px; padding: 16px 22px; background: var(--paper); border-left: 2px solid var(--oxblood); font-family: var(--serif); font-style: italic; font-size: 16px; color: var(--ink);">
          Thank you. Sam (or someone in the family) will be in touch shortly. Same-business-day usually means within four hours.
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- VISIT BLOCK -->
  <section class="section"
           style="background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, var(--paper-cream) 60%, transparent 100%);">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
        <div class="chapter-no">No. 02</div>
        <h2 class="h-1" style="text-transform: uppercase; max-width: 18ch;">The <em>atelier.</em></h2>
        <div class="right">318 Charlton Ave · Vaughan</div>
      </div>

      <div class="visit-block" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <p class="lede">A quiet room of wool, light, and patience. One client at a time &mdash; so each visit has the unhurried feel of an old tailor's workshop.</p>
          <p class="body-prose" style="margin-top: 18px;">
            First-time visits run about an hour and twenty minutes &mdash; a long look at what's in your wardrobe today, twenty-six measurements, a draft of the first pattern. Bring a jacket you wear often if you can. We'll measure it too.
          </p>

          <dl style="margin-top: 36px; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6;">
            <dt class="small-tag">Address</dt>
            <dd style="margin: 4px 0 18px; font-size: 19px; color: var(--ink);">
              318 Charlton Avenue<br/>
              Vaughan, Ontario · L4J 6H4
            </dd>
            <dt class="small-tag">Telephone</dt>
            <dd style="margin: 4px 0 18px;">
              <a href="tel:+16474580711" style="font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--ink); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);">647 &middot; 458 &middot; 0711</a>
            </dd>
            <dt class="small-tag">Email</dt>
            <dd style="margin: 4px 0 18px;">
              <a href="mailto:samskosher@gmail.com" style="font-size: 17px; color: var(--ink); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);">samskosher@gmail.com</a>
            </dd>
            <dt class="small-tag">On Instagram</dt>
            <dd style="margin: 4px 0 0;">
              <a href="https://instagram.com/samscustommenswear" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-no-transition style="font-style: italic; font-size: 17px; color: var(--ink); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);">@samscustommenswear</a>
            </dd>
          </dl>

          <h4 class="h-4" style="text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 36px; color: var(--navy);">Hours</h4>
          <dl style="margin-top: 14px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 160px 1fr; gap: 10px 24px; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 17px;">
            <dt class="chapter-no" style="font-style: italic;">Sun</dt><dd style="margin: 0;">10am &ndash; 6pm</dd>
            <dt class="chapter-no" style="font-style: italic;">Mon&ndash;Thu</dt><dd style="margin: 0;">11am &ndash; 7pm</dd>
            <dt class="chapter-no" style="font-style: italic;">Fri</dt><dd style="margin: 0;">Until 2hr before sundown</dd>
            <dt class="chapter-no" style="font-style: italic;">Sat &amp; Yom Tov</dt><dd style="margin: 0; color: var(--ink-mute);">Closed</dd>
          </dl>
        </div>

        <div class="visit-map" aria-label="Map of 318 Charlton Avenue, Vaughan">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 400 320" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" style="width:100%; height:100%; display:block;">
            <defs>
              <pattern id="grid-bk" width="22" height="22" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
                <path d="M22 0H0V22" fill="none" stroke="rgba(43,31,18,0.06)" stroke-width="1"/>
              </pattern>
            </defs>
            <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#grid-bk)"/>
            <g fill="none" stroke="rgba(43,31,18,0.34)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.8">
              <path d="M 0 90 L 400 110"/>
              <path d="M 0 200 L 400 220"/>
              <path d="M 120 0 L 100 320"/>
              <path d="M 260 0 L 280 320"/>
              <path d="M 60 60 L 380 280" stroke-width="1.2"/>
            </g>
            <g fill="none" stroke="rgba(180,138,58,0.5)" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round">
              <path d="M 0 250 Q 200 230 400 260"/>
            </g>
            <text x="20" y="100" fill="rgba(43,31,18,0.5)" font-family="Cormorant Garamond" font-style="italic" font-size="11" letter-spacing="2">RUTHERFORD&nbsp;RD</text>
            <text x="20" y="210" fill="rgba(43,31,18,0.5)" font-family="Cormorant Garamond" font-style="italic" font-size="11" letter-spacing="2">CHARLTON&nbsp;AVE</text>
            <text x="295" y="200" fill="rgba(180,138,58,0.6)" font-family="Cormorant Garamond" font-style="italic" font-size="11" letter-spacing="2">HWY&nbsp;7</text>
            <g transform="translate(210 160)">
              <circle r="22" fill="rgba(107,34,40,0.10)"/>
              <circle r="14" fill="rgba(107,34,40,0.18)"/>
              <circle r="6" fill="var(--oxblood)"/>
              <text x="0" y="-30" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink)" font-family="Cormorant Garamond" font-style="italic" font-size="14" letter-spacing="3">318&nbsp;CHARLTON&nbsp;AVE</text>
            </g>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="section tight">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
        <div class="chapter-no">No. 03</div>
        <h2 class="h-1" style="text-transform: uppercase; max-width: 18ch;">A few <em>honest answers.</em></h2>
        <div class="right">Before you book</div>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-grid cols-2" data-reveal-stagger>
        <div>
          <h3 class="h-3" style="text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--navy);">What does a first fitting cost?</h3>
          <p class="body-prose" style="margin-top: 12px;">Nothing. The first consultation is unhurried, candid, and obligation-free. If we work together, we'll quote the garment honestly before any cloth is cut.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="h-3" style="text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--navy);">How long does a suit take?</h3>
          <p class="body-prose" style="margin-top: 12px;">A first bespoke suit takes 8&ndash;12 weeks from measure to delivery, across two or three fittings. Wedding work is started 9&ndash;12 months out.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="h-3" style="text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--navy);">Do you alter existing suits?</h3>
          <p class="body-prose" style="margin-top: 12px;">Yes &mdash; particularly for our existing clients. Sleeve, hem, and trouser alterations are usually finished within five business days.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="h-3" style="text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--navy);">Can you come to my office or home?</h3>
          <p class="body-prose" style="margin-top: 12px;">For wedding parties, executives with consistent travel, and bedridden clients &mdash; yes. Sam will bring the tape, the cloths, and the notebook to you.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="h-3" style="text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--navy);">Is the atelier open on Shabbos or Yom Tov?</h3>
          <p class="body-prose" style="margin-top: 12px;">No. We're closed all Shabbos, Yom Tov, and chol hamoed. Fridays we close two hours before sundown to give the family time to prepare.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="h-3" style="text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--navy);">Is parking easy?</h3>
          <p class="body-prose" style="margin-top: 12px;">Yes &mdash; on-site, three spots reserved for clients, five minutes off Highway 7 and a six-minute walk from Rutherford GO.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="chapter-no" style="margin-top: 40px; text-align: center;">
        <a href="/faq" style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule-strong); padding-bottom: 2px; color: var(--ink);">More questions answered&nbsp;&nbsp;&rarr;</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
